# {{ .Name }}

A service built on [gox](https://github.com/guilhermebr/gox).

```
make run              # start on :8080 (admin on :9090)
make test lint        # what CI runs
go run ./cmd/{{ .Name }} --help   # every {{ .Prefix }}_* variable
```

- `cmd/{{ .Name }}/main.go`: what the service is made of.
- `internal/<feature>/`: one package per feature, each with `Register(a *gox.App)`.
{{- if .Postgres }}
- `migrations/`: SQL files run at boot by `postgres.WithMigrations`.
{{- end }}
{{- if .Web }}
- `web/layout/`: the page shell; `internal/<feature>/views/`: templ pages; `static/`: embedded assets (`make assets` vendors htmx and Alpine.js).
{{- end }}
- `.env.example`: every variable the service reads.

Health: `GET :9090/healthz` (liveness), `GET :9090/readyz` (readiness, also on :8080), `GET :9090/metrics`, `GET :9090/version`.

For agents: read `AGENTS.md`.
